&kp TAB         &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RBRC          &kp MINUS      &kp RIGHT_BRACKET  &kp RIGHT_BRACKET  &none                                                       &none                  &kp AT     &kp KP_N7   &kp KP_N8     &kp KP_N9      &kp KP_MINUS     &kp BSLH
&kp ESC         &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS   &kp LBRC          &kp UNDER      &kp LEFT_BRACKET   &kp PIPE           &none        &kp LCTRL  &kp LALT      &kp LGUI   &kp RCTRL  &none                  &kp HASH   &kp KP_N4   &kp KP_N5     &kp KP_N6      &kp KP_PLUS      &trans
&td_backup_sym  &kp LEFT_BRACKET       &kp GREATER_THAN  &kp LESS_THAN  &kp PLUS           &kp GRAVE                                  &kp HOME      &kp PG_UP                                    &kp COLON  &kp KP_N1   &kp KP_N2     &kp KP_N3      &kp KP_ENTER     &kp RSHFT
&mo 2           &trans                 &trans            &trans         &trans                                &smart_bspc  &kp DEL    &kp END       &trans     &kp ENTER  &sp_shift RSHFT KP_N0             &trans      &trans        &trans         &trans           &mo 2
            >;
